This is a modified version of youtube-webos, an open-source YouTube client for
LG webOS TVs released under GPL-3.0-only; the original code is copyright its
respective contributors. Modified in 2026: new application identity
(youtube.nextgen), Russian interface, OLED true-black mode, minimal settings
skin, new icons and artwork, previous branding removed. Includes fixes ported
from youtube-webos 0.8.5 beta 2 (see docs/upstream.md).

Third-party code and assets
- src/app_api/index.ts, src/lang-settings-fix.ts and parts of
  src/auto-login.js are adapted from TizenTube by reisxd (GPL-3.0).
- Emoji graphics are loaded at runtime from Twemoji (CC-BY 4.0).

Online services used at runtime: SponsorBlock (sponsor.ajay.app) and
Return YouTube Dislike (returnyoutubedislike.com).

